          <groundspeak:finder id="6252216">hunthikers</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP456 Kananaskis POW Camp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After a cold windy day at Nakiska, I detoured to pick up the brass cap at the UofC Field station / ex POW camp for the daily streak. Parked on an empty lot and made the short walk towards GZ before scrambling up a snowy slope but found the brass cap scoured by the wind.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="636343356">
