          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1108311">Trefoil/Voyager</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP456 Kananaskis POW Camp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Always a spot with nice color in the fall. Such a great day to be out here caching with GateKeeper and Peace Guy.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="636081710">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-09-09T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="233506">Gate Keeper</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP456 Kananaskis POW Camp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I cannot even imagine where I would be today were it not for that handful of friends who have given me a heart full of joy. Let's face it, friends make life a lot more fun. Today I enjoyed a nice walk with Peaceguy Trefoil/Voyager to retrieve some caches. The cap is pretty obvious when you get in the vicinity. It is in awesome shape, data was submitted  by peaceguy for our group. Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
